{"id":16,"date":"2019-12-18T14:39:51","date_gmt":"2019-12-18T13:39:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/strasbourgcarrelage.com\/?page_id=16"},"modified":"2023-12-04T17:11:45","modified_gmt":"2023-12-04T16:11:45","slug":"lentreprise","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/lentreprise\/","title":{"rendered":"Strasbourg Carrelage"},"content":{"rendered":"<section id=\"title-two-columns-block_5e00cb204de9d\" class=\"title-two-columns-block\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n                    <h2 class=\"block-title\"><p>D\u00e9couvrez<br \/>\n<strong>Notre entreprise familiale.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <p><strong>Strasbourg Carrelage est l\u2019entreprise familiale partenaire de vos projets depuis 1999. Nous avons vendu plus d\u20192 millions de m\u00e8tres carr\u00e9s de carrelage, en Alsace.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Cr\u00e9\u00e9e le 01 mai 1999, Strasbourg Carrelage est une soci\u00e9t\u00e9 sp\u00e9cialiste du carrelage depuis cinq g\u00e9n\u00e9rations, install\u00e9e dans la zone industrielle de la plaine des bouchers, \u00e0 quelques pas du Stade de la Meinau et du garage Citro\u00ean. Nous vous proposons un tr\u00e8s large \u00e9ventail de produits c\u00e9ramiques de toute l\u2019Europe !<\/p>\n<p>La tradition et le savoir-faire n\u2019excluent pas la nouveaut\u00e9. Bien au contraire ! Aussi, sommes-nous constamment en qu\u00eate de produits innovants et aux go\u00fbts du jour pour r\u00e9pondre aux demandes les plus diverses. Ici les produits classiques c\u00f4toient les r\u00e9f\u00e9rences les plus tendances. Ambiance Urbaine, influence du sud, design sobre, d\u00e9cor zen, atmosph\u00e8re color\u00e9e, mati\u00e8re brutes ou artisanales, collection vintage \u2026.<\/p>\n\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section id=\"three-images-block_5e00d1b9c7573\" class=\"three-images-block\">\n    <div class=\"row no-gutters\">\n                    <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/showroom.jpg\" class=\"background-image b-lazy\"  alt=\"showroom\" \/>\n            <\/div>\n                    <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/analise-resultado-duratex-dtex3-2t-2020.jpg\" class=\"background-image b-lazy\"  alt=\"analise-resultado-duratex-dtex3-2t-2020\" \/>\n            <\/div>\n                    <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/vendeur-de\u0301coration.jpg\" class=\"background-image b-lazy\"  alt=\"Couple choosing ceramic tiles in the shop\" \/>\n            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section id=\"red-content-block_5dfb80200d5d1\" class=\"red-content-block pictos\" style=\"background-color: \">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                            <div class=\"pictos\">\n                                            <div class=\"picto-wrapper\">\n                                                            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/picto-taille-humaine.svg\" alt=\"picto-taille-humaine\" class=\"picto\" \/>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"text-picto\">\n                                <p>Une entreprise familiale<br \/>\n<strong>\u00c0 taille humaine<\/strong><\/p>\n\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                                            <div class=\"picto-wrapper\">\n                                                            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/picto-ecoute.svg\" alt=\"picto-ecoute\" class=\"picto\" \/>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"text-picto\">\n                                <p>Des conseillers passionn\u00e9s<br \/>\n<strong>\u00c0 votre \u00e9coute<\/strong><\/p>\n\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                                            <div class=\"picto-wrapper\">\n                                                            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/picto-boutique.svg\" alt=\"picto-boutique\" class=\"picto\" \/>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"text-picto\">\n                                <p>300m2 de showroom pour<br \/>\n<strong>Un large choix<\/strong><\/p>\n\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                                            <div class=\"picto-wrapper\">\n                                                            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/picrto-surface.svg\" alt=\"picrto-surface\" class=\"picto\" \/>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"text-picto\">\n                                <p>Un travail d\u2019\u00e9quipe avec<br \/>\n<strong>Les meilleurs marques<\/strong><\/p>\n\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section id=\"two-columns-image-text-block_5e00d6323c92e\" class=\"two-columns-image-text-block\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"offset-xl-1 col-md-6 col-xl-5 order-md-0\">\n                <div class=\"content\">\n                    <h2 class=\"title\"><p>Un partenaire pour<br \/>\n<strong> les professionels<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/h2>\n                    <div class=\"text\">\n                        <p>Nos collaborateurs connaissent parfaitement les produits que nous distribuons et sauront <strong>r\u00e9pondre \u00e0 toutes les attentes de ses clients particuliers, comme celles des professionnels!<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Architectes, d\u00e9corateurs, bureaux d&rsquo;\u00e9tude, &#8230; <strong>tous les professionels du secteur viennent puiser leurs id\u00e9es parmi nos 17 000 R\u00e9f\u00e9rences<\/strong>. Nous leurs apportons toute notre expertise et informations sur les formats, l\u2019aspect, les coloris, les caract\u00e9ristiques techniques de nos carrelages.<\/p>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/contact\/\" title=\"Se rendre au Showroom \u00e0 Strasbourg\">Se rendre au Showroom \u00e0 Strasbourg<\/a>\n                                    <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"col-xl-5 col-md-6 order-md-1\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                                            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/showroom_1.jpg\" class=\"background-image b-lazy\" alt=\"showroom_1\" \/>\n                                    <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section id=\"two-columns-image-text-block_5e00d6853c92f\" class=\"two-columns-image-text-block\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"offset-xl-1 col-md-6 col-xl-5 order-md-1\">\n                <div class=\"content\">\n                    <h2 class=\"title\"><p>Tout pour votre projet d&rsquo;am\u00e9nagement,<br \/>\n<strong>\u00e0 un seul endroit<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/h2>\n                    <div class=\"text\">\n                        <p>Strasbourg Carrelage est toujours en qu\u00eate des <strong>derni\u00e8res innovations et des derni\u00e8res tendances<\/strong>! Ambiance urbaine, influence du sud, design sobre, d\u00e9cor zen, atmosph\u00e8re color\u00e9e, mati\u00e8re brutes ou artisanales, collection vintage&#8230; <strong>Vous trouverez forc\u00e9ment votre bonheur !<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Notre enseigne vous propose des gammes de carrelages terre cuite, faiences murales, carreaux metros, gres emaille, ardoise, dallage pour piscines, galets naturels, mosaiques&#8230; et bien plus encore!<\/p>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/destinations\/\" title=\"D\u00e9couvrir nos carrelages\">D\u00e9couvrir nos carrelages<\/a>\n                                    <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"col-xl-5 col-md-6 order-md-0\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                                            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/strasbourg_carrelage_famille_entreprise_Strasbourg_449187784.jpg\" class=\"background-image b-lazy\" alt=\"strasbourg_carrelage_famille_entreprise_Strasbourg_449187784\" \/>\n                                    <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section id=\"brands-list-block_5e01d35e46e4e\" class=\"brands-list-block\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-xl-8 mx-auto\">\n                <h3 class=\"h2 block-title\"><p>Nous travaillons avec<br \/>\n<strong>les meilleures marques<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/h3>\n                <div class=\"text\"><p>Nos produits sont certifi\u00e9s CSTB, NF, UPEC, ainsi que Ecolabel pour leur <strong>respect de l\u2019environnement.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n        <div class=\"brands row\">\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-3\">\n                    <div class=\"b